Jung Dowoon at Myung Hyunman.

14
00:00:56.256 --> 00:00:57.858
[contestant 3] Hindi inaasahan ang matchup na iyon.

15
00:00:58.358 --> 00:00:59.660
Magiging masaya yan.

16
00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.395
Jung Dawoon laban kay Myung Hyunman.

17
00:01:02.129 --> 00:01:03.230
Wow!

18
00:01:03.830 --> 00:01:07.334
