165
00:08:01.881 --> 00:08:04.117
- [contestant 5] Nakakamangha talaga iyon.
- Ito ay isang mahusay na labanan.

166
00:08:07.153 --> 00:08:09.122
Ang susunod na singsing na gusto kong piliin ay...

167
00:08:10.357 --> 00:08:11.591
Singsing No. 8.

168
00:08:12.092 --> 00:08:13.760
- [contestant 1] Wow.
- [contestant 2] No. 8?

169
00:08:14.627 --> 00:08:17.163
[contestant 3]
Singsing No. 8? Mukhang masaya din ang isang ito.

170
00:08:17.797 --> 00:08:19.099
[contestant 4] Whoa, ito ay Yang Sellchan.

171
00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:20.700
[contestant 5] Ah,
ito ang singsing ni Yang Sellchan.

172
00:08:21.234 --> 00:08:23.203
May kapangyarihan si Sellchan. Magaling siya.

173
00:08:23.937 --> 00:08:25.505
[contestant 6]
Mula sa Youth National Boxing Team.

174
00:08:26.673 --> 00:08:28.008
{\an8}Kumusta, ako si Yang Sellchan,

175
00:08:28.074 --> 00:08:30.677
{\an8}dating boksingero ng Youth National Team,
at ngayon ay isang pro boxer.

176
00:08:31.811 --> 00:08:35.715
Mayroon na akong tatlong panalo at isang tabla sa ngayon.

177
00:08:36.216 --> 00:08:37.283
Yung Korean scene

178
00:08:38.251 --> 00:08:40.253
medyo nililimitahan ako.

179
00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:41.988
Ang layunin ko ay maging isang world champion.

180
00:08:42.622 --> 00:08:44.657
Hindi mahalaga kung sino ang aking kalaban.

181
00:08:44.724 --> 00:08:45.725
Nandito ako para manalo.

182
00:08:47.093 --> 00:08:48.395
[contestant 1] Alam mo ba kung sino iyon?

183
00:08:48.461 --> 00:08:49.496
[contestant 2] Walang ideya.

184
00:08:49.562 --> 00:08:51.765
[announcer] <i>Sa pulang sulok,
mula sa prestihiyosong</i> ng Japan

185
00:08:51.831 --> 00:08:54.167
<i>Teiken Boxing Gym, Moon Youngwoong!</i>

186
00:08:55.168 --> 00:08:56.403
"Teiken"?

187
00:08:56.469 --> 00:08:57.704
"Teiken"?

188
00:08:57.771 --> 00:09:00.640
{\an8}Galing doon si Naoya Inoue, tama ba?

189
00:09:00.707 --> 00:09:01.708
{\an8}Ang kasalukuyang world champ.

190
00:09:01.775 --> 00:09:02.976
{\an8}NAOYA INOUE

191
00:09:03.043 --> 00:09:05.445
Tila,
ang kanyang ama ay dating nagtuturo kay Inoue.

192
00:09:06.079 --> 00:09:07.414
- Iyan ay ligaw.
- [Bulung-bulong si Dex]

193
00:09:08.114 --> 00:09:09.482
Hello, ako si Moon Youngwoong.

194
00:09:09.549 --> 00:09:14.054
Mahigit anim na taon na akong nagbo-boxing
sa Teiken Boxing Gym.

195
00:09:14.120 --> 00:09:18.124
Ang aking ama ay dating tagapagsanay ni Inoue,
kaya siya ang humawak ng kanyang bandage checks and such.

196
00:09:18.191 --> 00:09:21.928
Nag-training na talaga ako
katabi ko si Inoue.

197
