1769
01:17:07.690 --> 01:17:08.724
- Baliw!
- [Tumawa si Lee]

1770
01:17:08.791 --> 01:17:10.126
Wow, hindi ako makapaniwala dito.

1771
01:17:10.192 --> 01:17:12.361
- Natapos sila nang wala ang ikalawang kalahati.
- [Bulalas ni Jongkook]

1772
01:17:13.062 --> 01:17:14.063
[sigaw]

1773
01:17:14.130 --> 01:17:15.698
- Nanalo kami!
- [bulalas]

1774
01:17:16.899 --> 01:17:19.935
[Donghoe] Yung mga players na pumasok mamaya
gumawa ng napakagandang trabaho.

1775
