1788
01:17:49.431 --> 01:17:51.167
Nakakahiya naman.

1789
01:17:51.800 --> 01:17:53.102
Mahusay ang ginawa namin.

1790
01:17:53.169 --> 01:17:55.004
[Hyunman]
Dinala talaga ng team ko yung A-game nila.

1791
01:17:55.070 --> 01:17:56.305
Hindi lang ako makapaniwala na natalo kami.

1792
01:17:56.939 --> 01:17:57.940
Ito ay halos...

1793
01:17:58.574 --> 01:18:01.577
Parang nananaginip ako.

1794
01:18:01.644 --> 01:18:03.445
Nag-away kami ng maayos,

1795
01:18:03.512 --> 01:18:05.347
kaya mahirap paniwalaan na natalo tayo.

1796
01:18:06.215 --> 01:18:07.516
Nakakahiya naman.

1797
01:18:08.017 --> 01:18:10.152
TEAM KIM DONGHOE
VS TEAM MYUNG HYUNMAN

1798
01:18:10.219 --> 01:18:12.154
TALIWANAG ANG TEAM

1799
01:18:12.221 --> 01:18:15.958
{\an8}[Jongkook] Buo ang Team Red
ng mga baguhang mandirigma o dating manlalaban.

1800
01:18:16.025 --> 01:18:17.660
Panatilihin itong magkasama!

1801
01:18:17.726 --> 01:18:19.295
[contestant]
Panalo tayo, kahit anong mangyari.

1802
01:18:19.361 --> 01:18:21.664
- Tayo na!
- Gawin ang combo!

1803
01:18:21.730 --> 01:18:23.132
Magaling pumunta!

1804
01:18:23.199 --> 01:18:24.400
- Ano ang?
- Ito ay masama.

1805
01:18:24.466 --> 01:18:25.534
Damn it!

1806
01:18:26.068 --> 01:18:27.670
{\an8}Ito ang pagsikat ng mga underdog.

1807
01:18:27.736 --> 01:18:29.371
- Manalo tayo nito, guys!
- Tayo na!

1808
01:18:29.438 --> 01:18:31.106
- Ibuhos mo lahat!
- Huling isa!

1809
01:18:31.173 --> 01:18:32.608
Maaari ba nating iikot ito?

1810
01:18:32.675 --> 01:18:34.910
Isa pa lang! Ito na ang huli!

1811
01:18:34.977 --> 01:18:37.079
Bibigyan ka ng isa pang pagkakataon.

1812
01:18:37.146 --> 01:18:38.247
[Hyunman] Dumating na ang oras.

1813
01:18:38.847 --> 01:18:40.115
[Junseo] Itulak ko ang buong throttle.

1814
01:18:40.649 --> 01:18:41.917
[Kang] Confident ako. Oo.

1815
01:18:41.984 --> 01:18:43.118
- [tumunog ang kampana]
- [palakpakan ng mga kalahok]

1816
01:18:43.185 --> 01:18:45.087
- Nakakabaliw ito!
- Iyan ay brutal!

1817
01:18:45.154 --> 01:18:47.223
Ang nakaligtas sa deathmatch na ito ay...

1818
01:18:48.390 --> 01:18:50.926
[announcer] <i>Round 3 of</i> I Am Boxer.

1819
01:18:51.794 --> 01:18:52.928
Nakakabaliw ito!

1820
01:18:53.529 --> 01:18:54.563
<i>Ano ba yan?</i>

1821
01:18:54.630 --> 01:18:56.365
<i>Ang kamatayan ba ang tanging paraan para makaalis doon?</i>

1822
01:19:17.319 --> 01:19:19.321
Isinalin ni Jisu Park

